From 212c41d1f7576dae9869fb9a043eb63b47a8cade Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: snowf14k3 <60956553+snowf14k3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 13:22:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: venus: harden SM8150 encoder lifecycle

Match VPU5 downstream encoder protocol and power lifetime more closely.
Keep runtime power pinned across an active encoder stream. Consume one
coherent firmware buffer-requirements snapshot, preserve automatic H.264
level selection, and use the all-layer bitrate identifier.

Reject incomplete resources and malformed HFI replies. Keep protocol
setup and hardware DMA fail-closed behind independent opt-in gates.
Roll back core ownership before runtime suspend on startup errors.

Signed-off-by: snowf14k3 <60956553+snowf14k3@users.noreply.github.com>
---
